OL,3,GNEWSABomb squad called after ordnance
OL,4,Adonated for exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bomb disposal team were sent to
OL,7,FLerwick Town Hall in Shetland after
OL,8,Fsomeone donated a "possible ordnance
OL,9,Fdevice" to an upcoming exhibition.
OL,11,FRoads in the area were cordoned off
OL,12,Fafter the item was discovered at about
OL,13,F18:00 on Friday evening.
OL,15,FA spokesperson for Shetland Islands
OL,16,FCouncil said the local authority
OL,17,Freceived a donation of WW1 items for a
OL,18,Fdisplay which is due to take place,
OL,19,Fadding: "Among them was a possible
OL,20,Fordnance device, so the police were
OL,21,Finformed."
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
